Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, both the Summer and Autumn Dream Tickets...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,all Dream Tickets are in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let you get away with this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're gonna catch you and take our coords back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those commoners are not fit to wear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And they are vital to the exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But should I say as such yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The smiles will surely vanish from their faces this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:52.09,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fade(210,0)\blur0.9}Open that hidden door
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:58.72,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,120)\blur0.9}There's no need to be shy – within lies the wonderland of your dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:03.39,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}I wanna bring about a world all of my own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:09.07,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,210)}Like nothing you've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:14.40,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}Go on and bring all your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:17.70,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}This passport connects all lands and crosses all borders
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:23.33,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}It leads you to your destined stage
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.16,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:30.80,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}Dreams are made to come true, so seize that chance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.80,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}You can be the idol you've always dreamed of being
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:41.85,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}We can all bring about a miracle together
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:45.60,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}That shining, radiant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:49.48,OP5 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,250)\blur0.9}PriPara Fantasy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:52.09,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\fade(210,0)\blur0.9}himitsu no tobira wo akeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:58.72,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,120)\blur0.9}hazukashigaranaide soko wa suteki na wandaarando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:03.39,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}dare mo ga mita koto nai you na
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:09.07,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,210)}watashi dake no sekai meikingu shiyou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:14.40,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}tomodachi mitsukete sasottara
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:17.70,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}sore wa unmei no suteeji he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:23.33,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}tsunagaru (tsuzuku) saikou no pasupooto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.16,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:30.80,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}yume wa kanaeru mono chansu ni tsunageyou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.80,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}akogareteiru aidoru mezashite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:41.85,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}minna de issho ni kiseki okosou yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:45.60,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9}kirakira kagayakidasu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:49.48,OP5 - Roma,,0,0,0,[term fix],{\fade(0,250)\blur0.9}PriParis fantajii
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.47,0:02:08.02,Preview,,0,0,0,,{\fad(984,0)\blur1.5\bord0\fs129\pos(960,199.5)}Have a Good Fright
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:08.02,Preview,,0,0,0,,{\fad(984,0)\blur6\bord9\3c&HA104F3&\fs129\pos(960,199.5)}Have a Good Fright
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.47,0:02:08.02,Preview,,0,0,0,,{\fad(984,0)\blur1.5\fs129\pos(960,199.5)}Have a Good Fright
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.47,0:02:08.02,Preview,,0,0,0,,{\fad(984,0)\blur1.5\bord0\fs129\pos(960,879)}And a Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:08.02,Preview,,0,0,0,,{\fad(984,0)\blur6\bord9\3c&HA104F3&\fs129\pos(960,879)}And a Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.47,0:02:08.02,Preview,,0,0,0,,{\fad(984,0)\blur1.5\fs129\pos(960,879)}And a Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some special coords for this All Hallows' Eve!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,SoLaMi SMILE's members features all sorts of Halloween elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Bat Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And Dressing Pafé is spruced up in luxurious fluffy fake fur!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Ghost Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You look wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the once-in-a-year Halloween event!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we're bummed out that Phantom Thief Genius stole our coords,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],but we'll get them back. Meganii{-san} promised, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, if we're sad, then that means the phantom gets what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'd be happier than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're just doing what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,[term fix],You said it, Laala-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems dressing up as Phantom Thief Genius\N is really in vogue this Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressing up as him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he's a stinking thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There are those who hate him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and those who find him charming, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart wants what it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Meganee{-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those coords?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This way, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Those unique coords are another big trend\N from this year: local mascot dresses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Local mascot dresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They take inspiration from specialty goods Japan over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really one of a kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Amazing! Simply ravishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gorgeous! I want to wear one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Give us a smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many concepts here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And a jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So many homegrown specialties!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now jump for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Show me that smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm, gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You all look frightfully wonderful tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The costume contest will begin shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Presiding over the contest will be these and the other mascots judges!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:30.80,Kowai sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,0)\an8\blur1.05}FRIGHTS{\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs117\b0}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:35.43,Kowai sign,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1.5\pos(1347,652.5)\fade(0,100)}FRIGHTS!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who gathers the most frights wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.99,0:04:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will be bestowed a splendid crown and the title of "Miss Halloween"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don your most wonderful costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Make my and the judges hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tremble{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them... {\i1}tremble{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them tremble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Miss Halloween"...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All fright, that's super duper cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,[term fix],It's Laala{-tan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,[term fix],Long time no spook, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like someone just said my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It could have been a ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Mirei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a fearing I'd see you here! {fuck it I cannot figure this out so I tried for something that made sense in context}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! It's a lantern monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you remember me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there, old friends and new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Rantern! Pleased to scare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to scare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're really a ghost, right, Rantern?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's got your pri-tches in a knot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got legs and everything-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirei's fright! I'm a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A human...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're jumping at shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're predispositioned to expect something scary, so any stimulus provokes fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Deruderubii...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Deruderubii!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.69,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur0.75\1a&HFF&}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.69,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur1.5\bord0}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Well! Aroma{-san} has leapt into the top spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What... convincing acting-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you and Mikan both hated snakes, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but an imitation serpent is all the more adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Volume 1031, chapter 66 of the prophetic grimoire Aroma:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,take the form of the wicked and\Nbecome the harvest festival queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It means Aroma's gonna be Miss Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me; Ran{-tan}, you loved horror so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that you went to train at its home, Horriwood, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fright...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You've been to the one and only Horriwood which I, too, yearned for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Horriwood, crucible of all things horror, where kindred spirits gather! How I've longed to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:06:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,F–Fright...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you truly been admitted to Horriwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the least bit frightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, Rantern's a lot more...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all getting scared away by my {\i1}cuteness{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus I can declare:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're far from terrifying! Your paltry\Nfearsomeness is far outclassed by this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How perfectly peculiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that bizarre creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,[term fix],It's Neko before she puts on her makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop kitten around?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.33,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur0.75\1a&HFF&}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.33,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur1.5\bord0}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.29,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur0.75\1a&HFF&}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.29,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur1.5\bord0}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Hey, where'd Ran{-tan} go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she was so shocked she ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rantern!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's costumes are too amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true, Rantern!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I ended up dropping out of Horriwood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I tried to do horror makeup, it turns out cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried going to Horriwood to learn how to do it properly, but it just turned out worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Rantern...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My rokurokubi's necks wound up in bow knots...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My Yuki-onna winds up commenting on how warm it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not cold at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I dressed up as the classic villain from the 13th-generation Chainsaw Brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I brandished a towel instead of a chainsaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pri amazed you can even get it that wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I dropped out of Horriwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I become the bottom rank{-tan}...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you went to study horror,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but you developed your skills in cute makeup instead-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be pretty upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My mum says in times like this, you just need to believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can only make yourself look cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll help you with some scary makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you? Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear-y, fear-y wanna be Miss Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all pitch in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh no! Oh {\i1}no{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! I'm coming to suck your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],I'm on my last legs. I can't run anymore-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to plunge his fangs into my sweet, maidenly neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Chanko{-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chanko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The nape of your neck...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,should only be given to the one you love most.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Meganii{-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],You don't have to hold back, you know-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Glasses flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],He's running away-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still in a Dalí-mma over my Halloween costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As an art teacher, I must produce a costume that brings wonder and {terror}inspiration-Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind's a blank canvas...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Sir Ham, you've solved the Da Vinci code-Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank-ubrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm decided and I'm ready to throw down Rodin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my gaze and be turned to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop-tori! I don't want to be stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you vote for Aroma plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't freeze my supple skin-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.83,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\1a&HFF&}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.83,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\bord0}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen minutes remain until the costume contest ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aroma, in her arresting Medusa costume,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,has attained 58,114 frights!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Her lead is unchallenged!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,S–Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you liked snakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't handle the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.21,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I went to all the trouble...
Dialogue: 20,0:11:49.39,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Oh my! Fuwari{-san}, brandishing a real snake, has leapt into first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you can't beat the horror of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuwari's just got first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose to her, Ran{-tan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Red Flash makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}you{\i0} from the pri-vious year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This time is the 20-year aged Kishu red plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,See how it's a deeper colour and has lovely puckered skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared? I'm all sour and salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, she's sure cute-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is my shot-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To beat a snake,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,we need its arch enemy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fright, now I'm a mongoose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really cute-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,True, it's the natural foe of the pit viper,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but this costume has only multi-pri-ed her cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better dish up something pri spine-chilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Spine-chilling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a teru teru bozu charm-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Her face looks so friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When you said "ghost", this was all I could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ran{-tan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do it right after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You all did your best to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help what I look like, fright?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sizzling okonomiyaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sizzle, sizzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Si... zzle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How perfectly peculiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are we wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Monja outfits, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take the Miss Halloween crown and advertise our store at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's scamming two ostriches at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's "two birds with one stone"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dun-dun-Rodin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Da Vin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Da Vi–
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,... nci.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That statue's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What in blazes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dun-dun-Rodin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try and supp-Renaissance your surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll remem-brandt this forever:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's Ajimi The Thinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Wha? This statue is Ajimi{-sensei}?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rodin's "Thinker"-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A walking statue...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,a sculpture standing before me makes my heart tremble-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is living art-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Spam those frights-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:24.48,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(0,100)\blur0.75\1a&HFF&}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.35,0:14:24.48,Kowai sign - Blue,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(0,100)\blur1.5\bord0}FRIGHTS
Dialogue: 20,0:14:26.90,0:14:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a turnaround!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,With only five minutes remaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Ajimi{-san} has surpassed Fuwari and leapt into first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it-Picasa-Da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Cézanne the title of Miss Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses, again and again...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall be free of curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aroma's saying she's kind of mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fright...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These watery depths...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,were really awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The costume event has now concluded!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran{-tan} has become Miss Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Ran{-tan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:27.22,Default2,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Ran{-tan}-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you scary much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to all of you, I was able to become Miss Halloween! All fright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you all! For this performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,will you let me do your makeup and styling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your makeup sense will pri-pel us to greater heights of cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting the Coord Change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,To celebrate the winner of the costume contest, Ran{-tan},
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,today we have a special Number One Coord!{We Are Number One but every time they say "one" it's replaced by Mirei singing Pri-tto Perfect}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Idol Grand Prix Number One Coord!{We Are Number One but every time they say "one" it's replaced by the entirety of Minna de Mezase PriParis}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With the brilliant neon sewn into the dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll shine bright as the glittering stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Idol Grand Prix Number One Honey Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The "Number One" logo has been designed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,with a lovely big ribbon and a heart-shaped crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Idol Grand Prix Number One Honey Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran{-tan}'s makeup is perfect for getting everyone fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Making drama, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Halloween night!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Trick or Treat! Halloween Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What an amazing performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Ran{-tan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Fright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from Proadway who saw that performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted to invite you to join them as a makeup artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean {\i1}the{\i0} Proadway? From New Yorp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations! What a fantastic opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! Getting to work on the stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a giant creep forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.34,0:19:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great? Way to go-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.34,0:19:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,[honorific],Let's all snap PriTickets to celebrate{-chan}ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!{totally can't hear this line}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran{-tan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and get something to eat-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy it feels like I'm floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran{-tan} just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Disa-pri-eared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She–
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a ghost after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Owie-owie-owie...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fright here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave some prankfurters for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You will, fright?
